<title>INDIA: Indian rupee firms, RBI dollar buying expected.</title>
<headline>Indian rupee firms, RBI dollar buying expected.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>* The Indian rupee opens at 35.84/85 against the dollar, nearly unchanged from the previous close, dealers say;</p>
<p>* The rupee firms to 85.832/842 after opening.</p>
<p>* The market seen slightly long of dollars and awaits Reserve Bank of India (RBI)'s moves.</p>
<p>* RBI seen buying dollars if rupee holds these levels.</p>
<p>* Weekend remittances expected to add to supplies.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
